    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><strong>僞龍Pseudodragon</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">    神出鬼沒的僞龍棲息在世界的安靜之處，在樹窟或小巖洞中安家。它們長着棕紅色的角與鱗片，以及一張排滿鋒利尖牙的嘴。僞龍看起來就像一條性格頑皮的微型紅龍。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">    <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>安靜而謹慎Quiet and Defensive。</strong></em>僞龍對其他生物毫無興趣，也會盡可能的忽略它們。遭受攻擊時，僞龍會用尾部尖端的毒刺進行反擊，僅需一刺便可以使目標昏厥數小時。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">    <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>龍類魔寵Draconic Familiars。</strong></em>法師們喜歡僞龍和善的個性，其心靈感應能力以及對魔法的抵抗力，因而將其當作魔寵的上選。僞龍會在需要夥伴時精挑細選，但它們有時也會被禮物、食品或財寶取悅收買。尋找到合適夥伴的僞龍，一旦確定雙方能夠平等相處便會與之訂下契約。僞龍不會容忍自身遭到惡意對待，它會毫無預警地拋棄性情暴虐或善於擺佈他人的夥伴。<br />    <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>情緒語言Language of Emotion。</strong></em>僞龍無法言語，但它們可以用有限的心靈感應進行溝通，分享諸如飢餓、好奇或喜愛等基本情緒。與夥伴結成聯繫後，僞龍可以在很遠的距離外與其交流自身的所聞所見。<br />    僞龍經常發出動物般的叫聲。一陣粗礪的咕嚕聲代表愉悅，嘶嘶聲則意味着令人不快的意外。鳥似的鳴叫代表渴望，咆哮則往往意味着不滿與憤怒。<br /></p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Language of Emotion\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"4\"><strong>變體：僞龍魔寵Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar</strong></h4><p class=\"p\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:justify;TEXT-JUSTIFY:inter-ideograph;MARGIN:0pt 0pt 0pt 21pt;LINE-HEIGHT:13pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-para-margin-left:2.0000gd;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;text-align:justify\">    一些僞龍會願意作爲魔寵服務於施法者。這種僞龍將具備如下特質：</p></div></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Familiar\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">魔寵Familiar。</strong></em>僞龍可以作爲魔寵服務於其它生物，透過魔法與該自願的夥伴建立心靈連結。兩者建立連結後，只要兩方距離1裏範圍內，夥伴便可以感知僞龍感官所及之物。當僞龍身處其夥伴10尺範圍內時，其夥伴即可以分享僞龍的“魔法抗性”特質。僞龍可以隨時隨意的終止其服務，並中斷其心靈連結。</p><p>d.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Pseudodragon Familiar\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"1\"><strong>變體：僞龍魔寵Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar</strong></h4><p class=\"p\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:justify;TEXT-JUSTIFY:inter-ideograph;MARGIN:0pt 0pt 0pt 21pt;LINE-HEIGHT:13pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-para-margin-left:2.0000gd;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;text-align:justify\">    一些僞龍會願意作爲魔寵服務於施法者。這種僞龍將具備如下特質：</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:justify;TEXT-JUSTIFY:inter-ideograph;MARGIN:4pt 0pt 0pt 21pt;LINE-HEIGHT:13pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-para-margin-left:2.0000gd;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;text-align:justify\">  <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\">魔寵Familiar。</strong></em>僞龍可以作爲魔寵服務於其它生物，透過魔法與該自願的夥伴建立心靈連結。兩者建立連結後，只要兩方距離1裏範圍內，夥伴便可以感知僞龍感官所及之物。當僞龍身處其夥伴10尺範圍內時，其夥伴即可以分享僞龍的“魔法抗性”特質。僞龍可以隨時隨意的終止其服務，並中斷其心靈連結。</p></div><p></p><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Familiar\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>The elusive pseudodragon dwells in the quiet places of the world, making its home in the hollows of trees and small caves. With its red-brown scales, horns, and a maw filled with sharp teeth, a pseudodragon resembles a tiny red dragon but its disposition is playful.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Quiet and Defensive\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Quiet and Defensive.</span> Pseudodragons have little interest in other creatures, and they avoid them whenever possible. If it is attacked, a pseudodragon fights back using the poisonous stinger at the tip of its tail, one jab of which can put a creature into a catatonic state that can last for hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Draconic Familiars\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Draconic Familiars.</span> Mages often seek out pseudodragons, whose agreeable disposition, telepathic ability, and resistance to magic make them superior familiars. Pseudodragons are selective when it comes to choosing companions, but they can sometimes be won over with gifts of food or treasure. When a pseudodragon finds an agreeable companion, it bonds with that person as long as it is treated fairly.</p><p>A pseudodragon puts up with no ill treatment, and it abandons a manipulative or abusive companion without warning.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Language of Emotion\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Language of Emotion.</span> Pseudodragons can't speak, but they communicate using a limited form of telepathy that allows them to share basic ideas such as hunger, curiosity, or affection. When it bonds with a companion, a pseudodragon can communicate what it sees and hears even over long distances.</p><p>A pseudodragon often vocalizes animal noises. A rasping purr indicates pleasure, while a hiss means unpleasant surprise. A bird-like chirping represents desire, and a growl always means anger or discontent.</p><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"4\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar</span></h4><p>Some pseudodragons are willing to serve spellcasters as a familiar. Such pseudodragons have the following trait.</p></div></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Familiar\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Familiar.</span> The pseudodragon can serve another creature as a familiar, forming a magic, telepathic bond with that willing companion. While the two are bonded, the companion can sense what the pseudodragon senses as long as they are within 1 mile of each other. While the pseudodragon is within 10 feet of its companion, the companion shares the pseudodragon's Magic Resistance trait. At any time and for any reason, the pseudodragon can end its service as a familiar, ending the telepathic bond.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Pseudodragon Familiar\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"1\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Variant: Pseudodragon Familiar</span><span class=\"rd__h-toggle ml-2 clickable no-select no-print lst-is-exporting-image__hidden\" data-rd-h-special-toggle-button=\"true\" title=\"Toggle Visibility (CTRL to Toggle All)\">[–]</span></h4><p>Some pseudodragons are willing to serve spellcasters as a familiar. Such pseudodragons have the following trait.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Familiar\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Familiar.</span> The pseudodragon can serve another creature as a familiar, forming a magic, telepathic bond with that willing companion. While the two are bonded, the companion can sense what the pseudodragon senses as long as they are within 1 mile of each other. While the pseudodragon is within 10 feet of its companion, the companion shares the pseudodragon's Magic Resistance trait. At any time and for any reason, the pseudodragon can end its service as a familiar, ending the telepathic bond.</p></div></div></div>",
