    {
      "_id": "R6xzolTv4TAzpGNQ",
      "name": "釘刺Sting",
      "type": "weapon",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "254",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">近戰武器攻擊：</em>命中+4，觸及5尺，單一生物。<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">命中：</em>4（1d4+2）點穿刺傷害，目標必須成功通過DC 11的體質豁免否則中毒1小時。如果豁免失敗且骰值低出5或更低，則目標將在中毒持續時間內昏迷，受到傷害或其他生物用一個動作將其搖醒時也可以提前終止其昏迷效應。</p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+4]]{+4} to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 4 ([[/damage 1d4 + 2 type=piercing]]) damage, and the target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11]] saving throw or become &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 hour. If the saving throw fails by 5 or more, the target falls &amp;Reference[condition=unconscious] for the same duration, or until it takes damage or another creature uses an action to shake it awake.</p></div>",
